OL,3,GNEWSAMan escapes injury after shot
OL,4,Afired at property
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has escaped injury after a shot
OL,7,Fwas fired at a house in north Belfast.
OL,9,FPolice said the incident happened at a
OL,10,Fproperty in Boyd Street shortly before
OL,11,F21:30 GMT on Tuesday.
OL,13,FThe shot caused damage to a window,
OL,14,Fwalls and ceiling of the living room.
OL,16,FA man dressed entirely in black, with
OL,17,Fhis hood up covering his face, was seen
OL,18,Frunning from the scene towards Gardiner
OL,19,FPlace.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
